om.com/wiki/Lucy_Punch \"Lucy Punch\"","line":84},{"title":"![The Snow Scouts.","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/5/5f/Masked-kids.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20120529092251 \"Masked-kids.jpg (63 KB","line":90},{"title":"![Kidnapped by Firestarters.","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/2/2a/Kids-a-rowing.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20120529171835 \"Kids-a-rowing.jpg (52 KB","line":94},{"title":"![Concept Art (coatless).","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/6/66/Snowscoutconcept1.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/143?cb=20200217031724 \"Snowscoutconcept1.jpg (581 KB","line":100},{"title":"![Concept (coat).","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/2/23/Snowscoutconcept2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/144?cb=20200217031741 \"Snowscoutconcept2.jpg (589 KB","line":104},{"title":"![Quigley masked.","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/c/cf/Maskedquigley_fire.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20190927225000 \"Maskedquigley fire.png (2.99 MB","line":108},{"title":"![Reciting the pledge around the Campfire.","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/a/a4/Snowscout_fire.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20190927224938 \"Snowscout fire.png (2.51 MB","line":112},{"title":"![Hiking up Mount Fraught.","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/2/27/Snowscout_hike.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20190927230141 \"Snowscout hike.png (6.75 MB","line":116},{"title":"![Snow Scouts with Brucie.","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/3/39/Brucie_is_done%E2%84%A2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20190927230323 \"Brucie is done™.png (4.5 MB","line":120},{"title":"Brucie","target":"https://snicket.fandom.com/wiki/Brucie \"Brucie\"","line":122},{"title":"![YES LET'S ABANDON HER.","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net